            "content": "/*\n * Ledgerline — the demo design system for storyproof's examples.\n *\n * Paper-ledger editorial: warm cream paper, near-black ink, deep\n * ledger-green primary, vermillion for overdue states; serif display\n * headings, tabular monospace figures, hairline rules, hard offset shadows.\n *\n * Deterministic by construction, because these components exist to be\n * screenshot: system font stacks only (no webfont loading race, no network),\n * no animation in any captured state (transitions are hover-only), fixed\n * data, hand-drawn SVG sparklines. Identical in both examples.\n */\n\n:root {\n  --ll-paper: #f7f2e9;\n  --ll-card: #fffdf8;\n  --ll-ink: #201b16;\n  --ll-ink-soft: #6d6355;\n  --ll-rule: #d9cfc0;\n  --ll-green: #1d5b45;\n  --ll-green-deep: #14402f;\n  --ll-green-tint: #e2ede7;\n  --ll-red: #bc3d2b;\n  --ll-red-tint: #f6e3df;\n  --ll-amber-tint: #f3e8cf;\n  --ll-amber-ink: #7a5b12;\n\n  --ll-serif: georgia, \"times new roman\", times, serif;\n  --ll-sans:\n    -apple-system, \"segoe ui\", system-ui, \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;\n  --ll-mono: ui-monospace, \"cascadia mono\", menlo, consolas, monospace;\n\n  --ll-shadow: 0.1875rem 0.1875rem 0 var(--ll-ink);\n}\n\n/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- button */\n\n.ll-button {\n  appearance: none;\n  border: 2px solid var(--ll-ink);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-family: var(--ll-sans);\n  font-weight: 650;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  line-height: 1;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  transition:\n    transform 120ms ease,\n    box-shadow 120ms ease;\n}\n\n.ll-button--md {\n  font-size: 0.8125rem;\n  padding: 0.6875rem 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.ll-button--sm {\n  font-size: 0.6875rem;\n  padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem;\n}\n\n.ll-button--lg {\n  font-size: 0.9375rem;\n  padding: 0.9375rem 1.75rem;\n}\n\n.ll-button--primary {\n  background: var(--ll-green);\n  box-shadow: var(--ll-shadow);\n  color: var(--ll-paper);\n}\n\n.ll-button--primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: var(--ll-green-deep);\n  box-shadow: 0.25rem 0.25rem 0 var(--ll-ink);\n  transform: translate(-1px, -1px);\n}\n\n.ll-button--secondary {\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--ll-ink);\n}\n\n.ll-button--secondary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: var(--ll-ink);\n  color: var(--ll-paper);\n}\n\n.ll-button--danger {\n  background: var(--ll-red);\n  box-shadow: var(--ll-shadow);\n  color: var(--ll-paper);\n}\n\n.ll-button--danger:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  filter: brightness(0.9);\n}\n\n.ll-button:disabled {\n  border-color: var(--ll-rule);\n  box-shadow: none;\n  color: var(--ll-ink-soft);\n  background: transparent;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n.ll-button:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--ll-green);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- header */\n\n.ll-header {\n  align-items: center;\n  background: var(--ll-paper);\n  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ll-ink);\n  box-shadow: 0 3px 0 var(--ll-paper), 0 4px 0 var(--ll-ink);\n  display: flex;\n  font-family: var(--ll-sans);\n  gap: 2rem;\n  padding: 1rem 2rem;\n}\n\n.ll-header__wordmark {\n  color: var(--ll-ink);\n  font-family: var(--ll-serif);\n  font-size: 1.375rem;\n  font-style: italic;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\n.ll-header__wordmark::after {\n  color: var(--ll-green);\n  content: \".\";\n  font-style: normal;\n}\n\n.ll-header__nav {\n  display: flex;\n  flex: 1;\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.ll-header__link {\n  color: var(--ll-ink-soft);\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.ll-header__link:hover {\n  color: var(--ll-ink);\n}\n\n.ll-header__link--active {\n  box-shadow: inset 0 -3px 0 var(--ll-green);\n  color: var(--ll-ink);\n  padding-bottom: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.ll-header__auth {\n  align-items: center;\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.ll-header__welcome {\n  color: var(--ll-ink-soft);\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\n}\n\n.ll-header__welcome strong {\n  color: var(--ll-ink);\n}\n\n/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ page */\n\n.ll-page {\n  background:\n    repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      transparent 0,\n      transparent 2.4375rem,\n      rgb(32 27 22 / 4%) 2.4375rem,\n      rgb(32 27 22 / 4%) 2.5rem\n    ),\n    var(--ll-paper);\n  color: var(--ll-ink);\n  font-family: var(--ll-sans);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\n.ll-page__main {\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  max-width: 66rem;\n  padding: 3rem 2rem 4rem;\n}\n\n.ll-page__headline {\n  font-family: var(--ll-serif);\n  font-size: 2.625rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: -0.015em;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.ll-page__subline {\n  color: var(--ll-ink-soft);\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  margin: 0 0 2.5rem;\n}\n\n.ll-page__section-title {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ll-rule);\n  color: var(--ll-ink-soft);\n  font-size: 0.6875rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  margin: 2.75rem 0 1rem;\n  padding-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n/* ----------------------------------------------------------- stat cards */\n\n.ll-stats {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n}\n\n.ll-stat {\n  background: var(--ll-card);\n  border: 2px solid var(--ll-ink);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n  box-shadow: var(--ll-shadow);\n  padding: 1.125rem 1.25rem 1rem;\n}\n\n.ll-stat__label {\n  color: var(--ll-ink-soft);\n  font-size: 0.6875rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  margin: 0 0 0.625rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.ll-stat__row {\n  align-items: baseline;\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.625rem;\n}\n\n.ll-stat__value {\n  font-family: var(--ll-mono);\n  font-size: 1.75rem;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n}\n\n.ll-stat__spark {\n  color: var(--ll-green);\n  display: block;\n  margin-top: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.ll-stat__spark--down {\n  color: var(--ll-red);\n}\n\n/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- badges */\n\n.ll-badge {\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.6875rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  padding: 0.1875rem 0.5625rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.ll-badge--up {\n  background: var(--ll-green-tint);\n  color: var(--ll-green-deep);\n}\n\n.ll-badge--down {\n  background: var(--ll-red-tint);\n  color: var(--ll-red);\n}\n\n.ll-badge--paid {\n  background: var(--ll-green-tint);\n  color: var(--ll-green-deep);\n}\n\n.ll-badge--sent {\n  background: var(--ll-amber-tint);\n  color: var(--ll-amber-ink);\n}\n\n.ll-badge--overdue {\n  background: var(--ll-red-tint);\n  color: var(--ll-red);\n}\n\n/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- table */\n\n.ll-table {\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  font-size: 0.875rem;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.ll-table th {\n  color: var(--ll-ink-soft);\n  font-size: 0.6875rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  padding: 0 0.75rem 0.5rem 0;\n  text-align: left;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.ll-table td {\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--ll-rule);\n  padding: 0.6875rem 0.75rem 0.6875rem 0;\n}\n\n.ll-table__amount {\n  font-family: var(--ll-mono);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n.ll-table th.ll-table__amount {\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n.ll-table__invoice {\n  color: var(--ll-ink-soft);\n  font-family: var(--ll-mono);\n  font-size: 0.8125rem;\n}\n",
